{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-pdyc-greater-events",
    "name": "Greater Events — API",
    "description": "Spring Boot 3.4 — Microservicios Spring Cloud (TP5). Todas las requests entran por el **API Gateway** en `{{baseUrl}}` (`http://localhost:8081`), que valida el JWT de forma perimetral y lo reenvia (TokenRelay) al microservicio correspondiente (catalog-event, user-social, notification). Mantiene TP2/TP3/TP4.\n\n**Tres niveles de acceso (TP4):**\n- **Publicos** (sin token): `POST /auth/register`, `GET /artists`, `GET /artists/{id}/events`, `GET /events`, `GET /events/{id}`. Nunca devuelven eventos en estado `tentative`.\n- **Admin** (`/admin/**`): requiere Bearer JWT con realm role **admin** (claim `realm_access.roles`). Generar token con flujo Authorization Code usando `adminUsername` / `adminPassword` o desde el folder **Helpers**.\n- **End-user** (`/me/**`): requiere Bearer JWT con realm role **user**. Mismo flujo OAuth2, login con `endUserUsername` / `endUserPassword`.\n\n**Como obtener un token desde Postman:**\n1. Importar `Greater-Events-Local.postman_environment.json` y seleccionar **Greater Events — Local**.\n2. Sobre el folder **Admin endpoints** o **End-user endpoints**, abrir la pestana *Authorization* -> *Get New Access Token*. Postman ya tiene los valores pre-cargados desde el environment.\n3. Loguear con las credenciales correspondientes (admin: `tp3-user/tp3pass`; end-user: `tp4-user/tp4pass`).\n4. *Use Token* y disparar requests.\n\n**Errores estandar:** body JSON `{\"error\":\"mensaje\"}` con **400** (reglas/validacion), **401** (sin token / invalido), **403** (token valido pero rol insuficiente), **404** (no encontrado), **409** (username/email ya registrado).\n\nDocumentacion completa en el `README.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback" },
    { "key": "keycloakAuthUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/realms/unnoba/protocol/openid-connect/auth" },
    { "key": "keycloakTokenUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/realms/unnoba/protocol/openid-connect/token" },
    { "key": "keycloakClientId", "value": "pdyc" },
    { "key": "keycloakClientSecret", "value": "pdyc-secret-dev" }
  ],
  "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public endpoints (sin token)",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "description": "Catalogo publico y registro de usuarios finales. No requieren autenticacion.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register end user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"juan.perez\",\n  \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret123!\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Juan\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Perez\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "`POST /auth/register` — **201**. Crea el usuario en Keycloak (rol `user`) y en la DB local. `409` si username o email ya estan registrados."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List active artists",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/artists",
            "description": "`GET /artists` — todos los artistas con `active=true`, ordenados por nombre."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Artist upcoming events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/artists/{{publicArtistId}}/events",
            "description": "`GET /artists/{id}/events` — proximos eventos del artista (solo `confirmed` o `rescheduled` y con fecha futura). `404` si el artista no existe o esta inactivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List upcoming events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events",
            "description": "`GET /events` — eventos vigentes (`confirmed` o `rescheduled` con fecha futura), ordenados por proximidad de fecha. Nunca incluye `tentative`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get event by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{publicEventId}}",
            "description": "`GET /events/{id}` — detalle publico. Si el evento esta en estado `tentative` responde **404** (la consigna prohibe exponer informacion de eventos tentativos)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin endpoints (rol admin)",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Para todos los requests autenticate como **tp3-user / tp3pass** (rol `admin`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Users (Keycloak)",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List admin users", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users", "description": "`GET /admin/users` — lista usuarios de Keycloak." } },
            { "name": "Get admin user by id", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{adminUserId}}", "description": "`GET /admin/users/{uuid}`. Copiar el `id` del create response." } },
            {
              "name": "Create admin user",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin-postman\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\",\n  \"email\": \"admin-postman@example.com\",\n  \"first_name\": \"Admin\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Postman\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"temporary_password\": false\n}" },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users",
                "description": "`POST /admin/users` — **201**. TP4: ademas de crear el usuario en Keycloak le asigna automaticamente el realm role **admin**."
              }
            },
            { "name": "Delete admin user", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{adminUserId}}", "description": "`DELETE /admin/users/{uuid}` — **204**." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Artists",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List artists", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists", "description": "`GET /admin/artists`" } },
            { "name": "List artists (filter genre)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists?genre=rock", "description": "Filtra por genero: rock | techno | pop | jazz | folk." } },
            { "name": "Get artist", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistIdInLineup}}" } },
            { "name": "Create artist", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Artista Postman\",\n  \"genre\": \"jazz\"\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists" } },
            { "name": "Update artist", "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nombre actualizado\",\n  \"genre\": \"pop\"\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistIdFree}}" } },
            { "name": "Delete artist", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/artists/{{artistIdFree}}" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Events",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List events", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events" } },
            { "name": "List events (filter state)", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events?state=tentative" } },
            { "name": "Get event by id", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}" } },
            { "name": "Create event", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Festival Demo\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2030-12-01T20:00:00\",\n  \"description\": \"Descripcion del evento\"\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events" } },
            { "name": "Update event", "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Festival Demo (editado)\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2030-12-02T21:00:00\",\n  \"description\": \"Nueva descripcion\"\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}" } },
            { "name": "Delete event", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}" } },
            { "name": "Add artist to event", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"artist_id\": {{artistId}}\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/artists" } },
            { "name": "Remove artist from event", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/artists/{{artistIdInLineup}}" } },
            { "name": "Confirm event", "request": { "method": "PUT", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventId}}/confirmed", "description": "TP4: dispara notificaciones a usuarios con el evento favorito o con artistas seguidos en el lineup." } },
            { "name": "Reschedule event", "request": { "method": "PUT", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"start_date\": \"2031-01-15T22:00:00\"\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventIdConfirmed}}/rescheduled", "description": "TP4: dispara notificaciones." } },
            { "name": "Cancel event", "request": { "method": "PUT", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/events/{{eventIdConfirmed}}/canceled", "description": "TP4: dispara notificaciones." } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "End-user endpoints (rol user)",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "callbackUrl", "value": "{{callbackUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloakAuthUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientId", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "clientSecret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "scope", "value": "openid", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "client_authentication", "value": "body", "type": "string" }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Para todos los requests autenticate como **tp4-user / tp4pass** (rol `user`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Following (artistas seguidos)",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List following", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following", "description": "`GET /me/following` — artistas que sigue el usuario autenticado." } },
            { "name": "Follow artist", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"artist_id\": {{followArtistId}}\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following", "description": "`POST /me/following` — **201**. `400` si el artista esta inactivo o ya es seguido. `404` si no existe." } },
            { "name": "Unfollow artist", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following/{{followArtistId}}", "description": "`DELETE /me/following/{artistId}` — **204**." } },
            { "name": "Upcoming events from followed artists", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following/events", "description": "`GET /me/following/events` — proximos eventos (`confirmed` o `rescheduled` con fecha futura) donde participa alguno de los artistas seguidos, ordenados por fecha." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Favorite events",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List favorite events", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events", "description": "`GET /me/favorite-events` — favoritos del usuario que aun esten vigentes." } },
            { "name": "Add favorite event", "request": { "method": "POST", "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"event_id\": {{favoriteEventId}}\n}" }, "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events", "description": "`POST /me/favorite-events` — **201**. `400` si el evento es `tentative` o ya es favorito." } },
            { "name": "Remove favorite event", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/favorite-events/{{favoriteEventId}}", "description": "`DELETE /me/favorite-events/{eventId}` — **204**." } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Notifications",
          "item": [
            { "name": "List notifications", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications", "description": "`GET /me/notifications` — lista todas las notificaciones del usuario." } },
            { "name": "List unread notifications", "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications?unread_only=true", "description": "Filtra solo las que no fueron marcadas como leidas." } },
            { "name": "Mark notification as read (PATCH)", "request": { "method": "PATCH", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}", "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ], "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"is_read\": true\n}" }, "description": "`PATCH /me/notifications/{id}` con body `{\"is_read\": true}` (Anexo TP4)." } },
            { "name": "Mark notification as read (PUT alias)", "request": { "method": "PUT", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read" } },
            { "name": "Delete notification", "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}", "description": "`DELETE /me/notifications/{id}` — elimina la notificacion del usuario." } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Helpers",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "description": "Utilidades de autenticacion. El **Refresh access token** (Anexo TP4) renueva el access token sin reingresar credenciales usando el refresh token obtenido en el login.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Refresh access token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{keycloakClientId}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{keycloakClientSecret}}" },
                { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "{{refreshToken}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{keycloakTokenUrl}}",
            "description": "`POST` al token endpoint de Keycloak con `grant_type=refresh_token` (Anexo TP4). Devuelve un nuevo `access_token` y un `refresh_token` rotado sin pedir usuario/contrasena. Pegar el refresh token recibido en el login en la variable de entorno `refreshToken`."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
